docs/design/interactive-agent-communication-01-requirements.md:1757:14.5.6 The step-2 rulings that are not change requests are placed as follows (corrected in v0.5.1; v0.5 said they were left in the threat model). OQ-1 (adversaries ADV-11..ADV-14): section 2.3 and D-1. OQ-2 (per-agent accounts as the committed target): R-82 and the step 3 and 4 handoff in 13.5. OQ-5 (the failures the store survives): R-15.o, R-15.d, R-15.e. OQ-15 (retention): folded by dropping CR-16 (14.2) and by R-51.a, which already forbids a per-message digest beyond the 14-day stage memory and separates it from the daily telemetry digests; v0.5.1 added the revisit trigger. OQ-9 beyond the numbers (each starting value measured in the first build) is 14.3 and 13.5.2.
